// 12 October 2026: the "ask for feedback" mail written after a refusal (first case: Voodoo, Tech Artist, Portfolio team).
// Matthieu's rule: after a refusal, a short mail asks the studio what did not work, so the next application improves.
// Pure module: same studio, same text. Every sentence lives in FEEDBACK_REQUEST (one place to change a wording), and a
// placeholder with no value throws, it never ships a half-filled mail. Nothing here ever sends anything.
//
// FR : le mail « demander un retour » qui suit un refus. Module pur : meme studio, meme texte. Chaque phrase vit dans
// FEEDBACK_REQUEST (un seul endroit pour changer une formulation), un emplacement sans valeur leve une erreur au lieu de
// livrer un mail a moitie rempli. Rien n'est jamais envoye d'ici.
import { toIsoDate } from './freelanceStudios.js'

export const FEEDBACK_LANGS = ['en', 'fr']

/** The central parameters: wording, order and signature. A block id in `layout` must exist in `blocks`. */
export const FEEDBACK_REQUEST = {
